{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":33,"ref":"genesis 30:33","book":"genesis","lang":"om","chapter":30,"translation":"Sirriin koo guutuu maxxantuu fi miilla-cabdu goattonni keenya jala baasuu — kunummoo shaakala koo ta'a. Guyyaa boruutti yeroo fuula duraa keetti kufrii koo irratti seetu, sirriin koo natti deebisa. Waan hundi goattonni maxxanuu fi miilla-cabsan hin taane, hoolsota immoo diimaa-addee hin taane — nama ajjeesame akka naatiitti isa waliin hubatama.","tokens":[{"surface":"וענתה","gloss":"deebisa"},{"surface":"בי","gloss":"natti"},{"surface":"צדקתי","gloss":"sirriin koo"},{"surface":"ביום","gloss":"guyyaa"},{"surface":"מחר","gloss":"boruutti"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"yeroo"},{"surface":"תבוא","gloss":"seetu"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"irratti"},{"surface":"שכרי","gloss":"kufrii koo"},{"surface":"לפניך","gloss":"fuula duraa keetti"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"waan hundi"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"waan"},{"surface":"איננו","gloss":"hin taane"},{"surface":"נקד","gloss":"maxxanuu"},{"surface":"וטלוא","gloss":"fi miilla-cabsan"},{"surface":"בעזים","gloss":"goattonni"},{"surface":"וחום","gloss":"immoo diimaa-addee"},{"surface":"בכשבים","gloss":"hoolsota"},{"surface":"גנוב","gloss":"nama ajjeesame akka naatiitti"},{"surface":"הוא","gloss":"isa"},{"surface":"אתי","gloss":"⟨את⟩ waliin naatiitti"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-29T04:41:37.476078818Z","model":"glm-5.3"}